      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠶᠢᠨ</unicode>
      <uighur>yin</uighur>
      <transcript>JIN</transcript>
      <definition>[used after vowels and diphthongs; = u, y (after "n"); = un, yn (after consonants other than n). A suffix of the genitive case.</definition>
